   "en": "⟦0⟧ is a minor country in Western Europe with a population of ⟦1⟧ (core) and an additional ⟦2⟧ (non-core) population. Located on the Iberian peninsula, its mainland is bordered only by ⟦3⟧. Portugal has several colonies scattered around the world including Macau in China, Portuguese Timor in Indonesia, Goa in India, Sao Tome, Cape Verde, Portuguese Guinea, Angola, and Mozambique in Africa.",
